  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g7383212-d12051078-r1051738656-Quest_Macquarie_Park-Macquarie_Park_Ryde_Greater_Sydney_New_South_Wales.html",
  "title": "Poor cleaning",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Stayed here last week and unfortunately the experience was disappointing overall.\n\nIf a hotel is advertised as pet-friendly, any extra pet fees should be disclosed on the website or before arrival so guests can budget accordingly.\n\nWhen we entered the room, the kitchenette floor was dirty and the toilet floor, mirror, and carpet needed cleaning. We reported it immediately and two cleaners came and did a good job — but this shouldn’t have been necessary right after check-in.\n\nHousekeeping on Friday only replaced towels and removed rubbish (bed was not made). On Saturday we were told bed-making was part of a “full service” and would be done on request, but no one came. Later we were told there is no housekeeping at all on weekends — not even basic service — so we spent the rest of our stay until Sunday with the same towels and rubbish.\n\nThe only highlight was one very helpful receptionist who lent us cable extensions so we could connect our CPAP machines since there were no accessible power outlets by the beds. Her help was genuinely appreciated.\n\nI hope management can improve communication and cleaning standards for future guests.",
