    "publishedDate": "2026-02-24",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Hello Shamil,\n\nThank you for your wonderful review and for choosing to stay with us. We are delighted to hear that you found the booking and check-in process easy and that our team made you feel welcome.\n\nIt’s especially pleasing to know that travelling with your pets was a smooth and comfortable experience — we understand how important that is and are proud to be a pet-friendly property. I’m also glad you found the room clean, amenities in good working order, parking convenient, and that you were able to enjoy a quiet and restful stay.\n\nWe truly appreciate your kind feedback and look forward to welcoming you (and your pets) back again soon.\n\nKind regards,\n\nAmit\nGeneral Manager\nQuest Macquarie Park",
