    "translationType": null,
    "publishedDate": "2026-02-11",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Hi 468bronwyn,\n\nThank you so much for your continued support and for taking the time to share such a detailed review. I’m delighted to hear you keep returning to Quest Macquarie Park and that you enjoy our location, facilities, and the comfort of our apartments — especially the well-appointed kitchen/kitchenette, bathrooms, and comfortable beds.\n\nIt’s also great to know you’ve found check-in and check-out quick and easy, and that both our complimentary outdoor parking and covered onsite parking options have worked well for you.\n\nThank you again for the recommendation — we truly appreciate it and look forward to welcoming you back on your next business trip.\n\nWarm regards,\nAmit\nGeneral Manager\nQuest Macquarie Park",
    "username": "Quest Macquarie Park",
