  "title": "Business stay",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "I continue to return to the Quest Macquarie Park as it's location and facilities are great. There is usually plenty of outside parking (free), although I prefer to use the covered carpark (which has a fee per night). The apartments are well appointed with kitchens or kitchenettes and good bathrooms. The beds have been comfortable each time I have stayed. Check-in is fast and efficient and it is easy to check out. Overall, I highly recommend this Quest!",
